Package: monolith
Title: Spatial Analysis Dashboard
Version: 0.9.8
Description: A Shiny application for spatial statistical analysis, geostatistical
    modeling, and mapping. Provides deterministic and geostatistical interpolation
    (IDW, TPS, OK, CK, RK, RFK), cross-validation diagnostics, descriptive
    analytics, PCA, and governing factors analysis via Random Forest + DALEX.
Authors@R: c(
    person("Serda", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
